Data attribution
================

This project reads the GTFS feed "Telangana opendata GTFS TGSRTC" published by
Open Data Telangana (https://data.telangana.gov.in/) for the Telangana State
Road Transport Corporation (TGSRTC).

Licence of the data: the maintainer uses the feed under a free, worldwide,
non-exclusive licence for use, adaptation and redistribution of the data and
derived works. This reflects the maintainer's understanding of the publisher's
open-data terms; it has not been separately confirmed in writing with the
publisher. If you rely on the data, check the terms on the publisher's dataset
page yourself. Attribution to the publisher (Open Data Telangana / TGSRTC) is
given in the site footer and here.

The feed itself is NOT included in this repository.

Independence and trademarks
---------------------------
This is an independent open-source project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
operated by TGSRTC or the Government of Telangana. The names "TGSRTC" and "Telangana State
Road Transport Corporation" are used only to say what the data describes. The TGSRTC logo is
NOT used; the bus mark in web/logo.svg is original to this project (MIT licensed).

Third-party material
--------------------
- Base map data: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright),
  served as vector tiles by OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org/) using OpenMapTiles.
- MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause, https://maplibre.org/), vendored under web/vendor/.
- Address search: Nominatim (https://nominatim.org/) running on openstreetmap.org, data (c)
  OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). The page contacts it only when a visitor presses Enter or
  "Search address", and sends just the search text (plus the usual IP address and Referer).
  Set `geocoder: null` in web/js/config.js to remove the feature and that request.
